		<string key="description" value="The proposed project located at 1033-1055 Washington Street includes the construction of two life science/office buildings (with an above-grade connection between the buildings) approximately 150 feet in height with an aggregate gross floor area of approximately 588,000 square feet. The Project will include ground-floor retail/restaurant space, community/non-profit space, two levels of below-grade parking, a landscaped pedestrian plaza between the buildings connecting Washington Street and Shawmut Avenue, and related Site improvements and amenities." />
		<string key="phase" value="Board Approved" />
		<string key="project_type" value="Large Project" />
