		<string key="description" value="102 - 110 Savin Hill Ave, LLC propose a mixed-use development of two (2) buildings with a combined total of approximately 23,983 square feet.  One is a three-story, residential building located at 10-14 Sydney Street with nine (9) condominium units.  The second is a three-story building for commercial retail use located at 102-110 Savin Hill Avenue. In addition, the proposal includes on-site/off-street parking for up to thirteen (13) spaces." />
