		<int key="land_sqft" value="13597" />
		<int key="gross_floor_area_sqft" value="15680" />
		<string key="description" value="Urbanica (the &quot;Proponent&quot;) proposes the construction of a new, four (4)-story residential building at 120 - 122 Hancock Street in Dorchester, on a parcel which has been designated to Urbanica for redevelopment by the City of Boston's Department of Neighborhood Development. &#10;&#10;The Proponent proposes an approximately 20,500 square foot building, inclusive of fifteen (15) residential homeownership units, nine (9) on-site vehicular parking spaces, community space, accessory bike room, and other supportive spaces. &#10;&#10;As proposed, the residential unit mix three (3) 1-bedroom units and twelve (12) 2-bedroom units. All fifteen (15) units will be deed-restricted affordable units. Eight (8) units will be affordable to households earning not more than 80% AMI. Seven (7) units will be affordable to households earning not more than 100% AMI." />
		<string key="phase" value="Construction Complete" />
		<string key="project_type" value="Small Project" />
