		<int key="land_sqft" value="35988" />
		<int key="gross_floor_area_sqft" value="125694" />
		<string key="description" value="The Proponent now proposes to amend the Project as previously described in the Board Memo&#10;dated and approved on November 16, 2017, to reduce the number of overall off-street parking&#10;spaces from one hundred and ten (110) to forty-seven (47) and clarify for the record the proposed layout of the building. The previously approved project included a total of ninety-four (94) homeownership units that included twelve (12) IDP homeownership units. The current project remains the same and the proposed sizes and locations of the IDP units remain unchanged from the previous approval. No changes to the building footprint are being. The proposed changes to the Project are a result of the approved building’s location directly above an MBTA train tunnel, which has created financial hardship as well as construction and structural concerns for both the proposed structure and infrastructure below." />
