		<string key="address" value="140 Wachusett Street" />
		<int key="land_sqft" value="18591" />
		<int key="gross_floor_area_sqft" value="36164" />
		<string key="description" value="The development proposal is for a new residential building comprising 38 units and 17 parking spaces. This proposal also seeks to raze the existing vacant structure on the lot. The proposed building would be situated on an 18,591-square-foot lot that is bordered by Patten Street, Wachusett Street, and Walk Hill Street. The proponent seeks to incorporate the lot’s existing rock ledge, maintain the existing right of way off Walk Hill Street, and provide new housing, landscape and outdoor space for residents. This proposal would also include a bike room capable of housing 38 bicycles." />
		<string key="phase" value="Under Review" />
		<string key="project_type" value="Small Project" />
