		<string key="address" value="1725 Hyde Park Avenue" />
		<int key="land_sqft" value="238068" />
		<int key="gross_floor_area_sqft" value="0" />
		<string key="description" value="The Project Site consists of approximately 119,034 square feet (approximately 2.7 acres) of commercial/industrial land bounded by Hyde Park Avenue, Milton Street, and the MBTA commuter rail tracks. The Proposed Project contemplates the construction of two modern self-storage buildings to be developed in two phases. Phase 1 will consist of a five-story building containing approximately 196,000 square feet of self-storage (“Warehouse”) space. Phase 2, which will commence only after the issuance of a Certificate of Occupancy for Phase 1 by the Inspectional Services Department, will consist of a second five-story building containing approximately 129,000 square feet of self-storage (“Warehouse”) space. Upon completion, the Proposed Project will provide a maximum of fifty-nine (59) off-street parking spaces serving the facility." />
		<string key="phase" value="Letter of Intent" />
		<string key="project_type" value="Large Project" />
		<event>
