		<string key="description" value="The Proposed Project consists of approximately 285,000 square feet. The program will include 400 residential units, 2,400 SF retail at the Ipswich Street level and indoor bike parking for 200 bikes. The Proponent is proposing the Project to provide 68 units (17%) of on site affordable housing units exceeding the City of Boston’s applicable IDP requirements. There is no onsite parking planned for the Project. A new publicly accessible open stair and enclosed public elevator is proposed, joining Ipswich Street with Boylston Street and providing access to the Back Bay Fens." />
