		<string key="description" value="The NPC proposes the construction of a pedestrian bridge connecting the third floor of ISQ2 to the third floor of ISQ3 over Northern Avenue, providing a weather-protected, efficient, safe passageway for laboratory staff and employees to transport materials between the buildings’ facilities. The NPC Project includes approximately 1,440 square feet of new construction with minimum clearance height of approximately 32.5 feet over all portions of Northern Avenue and a minimum clearance height of approximately 33.75 feet over the Northern Avenue cartway itself, for truck traffic." />
