		<string key="description" value="The Project includes refurbishing hotel guest rooms (including repurposing five guest rooms into a club lounge), a renovated ground floor lobby area, upgraded conference facilities, a new ballroom, and restyled restaurants.  In addition, the Project will include exterior marquee, lighting, signage and canopy improvements. Except for the exterior cosmetic improvements, all of the work for the Project will be undertaken within the existing building footprint." />
