		<int key="gross_floor_area_sqft" value="47909" />
		<string key="description" value="The proposed project would raze the existing distressed single-family dwelling and preserve, repurpose, and expand the existing structure of the Hill Memorial Baptist Church into a four (4) story building with 49 units of income-restricted senior housing units and a new connected structure with program space for the residents of the new development (the “Proposed Project”). The basement of the former church building will provide a public space for continued and enhanced community use, and the overall development program will incorporate an extensive array of open spaces, with at-grade surface parking for 15 vehicles accessed from Easton Street." />
		<string key="phase" value="Board Approved" />
		<string key="project_type" value="Small Project" />
