		<int key="land_sqft" value="52941" />
		<int key="gross_floor_area_sqft" value="225235" />
		<string key="description" value='This Notice of Project Change (NPC) is being submitted by Cruz Development Corporation (the "Proponent").&#10;&#10;On December 15, 2016, the BPDA approved an Overall Proposed Project consisting of 95-units of new family and elderly residential housing units, 11,334 square feet of commercial space, a coffee shop and restaurant, and 102 parking spaces in a two-level garage completed over two construction phases.&#10;&#10;The Phase 1 Project, which has been completed, included the construction of a four-story building consisting of 55 units of housing, 7,284 gsf of commercial/office space, and 74 parking spaces in a two-level garage located on the Warren and Clifford Streets portion of the project.&#10;&#10;The Phase 2 portion of the project, to be known as One Waverly, which was originally approved for 44 units of elderly multi-family residential housing is now being proposed for a total of 48 units of affordable multi-family rental housing for households with incomes below 30% of average median income (AMI) and up to 120% of AMI. There will be 3,483 sf of available commercial space at the ground floor, and 24 garage parking spaces. In addition, the Phase 2 building will meet Passive House sustainability requirements.' />
		<string key="phase" value="Under Construction" />
		<string key="project_type" value="Large Project" />
