	<trace>
		<string key="concept:name" value="3219" />
		<int key="project_id" value="3219" />
		<string key="name" value="33-61 Temple Street" />
		<string key="url" value="https://www.bostonplans.org/projects/development-projects/33-61-temple-street" />
		<boolean key="in_article_80" value="true" />
		<string key="neighborhood" value="Beacon Hill" />
		<string key="address" value="33-61 Temple Street" />
		<int key="land_sqft" value="29606" />
		<int key="gross_floor_area_sqft" value="131119" />
		<string key="description" value='On November 19th, 2018 the BPDA received a Notice of Project Change ("NPC") from JDMD Owner, LLC (the "Proponent") relative to the 33 - 61 (45) Temple Street development project in Beacon Hill.&#10;&#10;The Proponent received approval from the BPDA Board on July 14th, 2016 for the redevelopment of the former Archer and Donahue buildings at 33 - 61 Temple Street into a seventy-one (71) unit residential condominium building, with approximately 5,745 square feet of amenity space, and up to fifty-four (54) parking spaces in a below-grade garage, and covered storage for a maximum of seventy-five (75) bicycles in the building. &#10;&#10;The NPC submitted by the Proponent to the BPDA on November 19th, 2018 proposes a slight change to the originally approved and adjusted Project as follows: &#10;&#10;Changes to Number of Units: The Proponent proposes the Project to now include sixty-two (62) residential units as follows: fourteen (14) one-bedroom units, twenty-five (25) two-bedroom units, twenty (20) three-bedroom units, and three (3) four-bedroom units' />
		<string key="phase" value="Under Construction" />
		<string key="project_type" value="Large Project" />
