		<string key="description" value="The Proposed Project involves the demolition of the existing structure on a 6,450 square foot lot to allow for the construction of a new (6) six-story, mixed-use building. The building will include approximately 1,007 square feet of ground-floor retail space, nineteen (19) condominium units, and seventeen (17) off-street parking spaces. In total, the new structure will encompass roughly 27,969 square feet and will provide twenty (20) residential bicycle parking spaces, along with six (6) additional bike spaces designated for visitors." />
