		<string key="description" value="On August 15, 2019, the BPDA Board approved the construction of a new, four (4)-story residential building containing 38 rental units (including 6 IDP Units) and 46 garage parking spaces on the presently vacant lot at 43 Lochdale Road in Roslindale.&#10;&#10;The Proponent submitted a Small Project Change to the BPDA on March 4, 2021 proposing a change in programming for the 43 Lochdale Road project from rental units to condominiums." />
		<string key="phase" value="Board Approved" />
		<string key="project_type" value="Small Project" />
