		<string key="description" value="The proposed multifamily residential building would have a total gross floor area of approximately 157,000 gross square feet, and a building height of up to 21 residential stories, and approximately 240 feet, measured to the top of the mechanical penthouse.  The new building would include up to 176 dwelling units, approximately 20 accessory parking spaces, and off-street loading.&#10;The NPC approved on April 15, 2021, changed the previously approved project from residential rental units to residential ownership units. No other aspects of the 47-55 Lagrange Street project, such as building size, was subject to change." />
