		<int key="gross_floor_area_sqft" value="30150" />
		<string key="description" value="Located at 59-63 Belgrade Ave (two parcels) in Boston’s Roslindale neighborhood, the project contemplates the demolition of a one story funeral home in order to construct a 4-story 31 rental residential building with parking area below containing 23 parking spaces. The proposed project will include fifteen(15) one bedroom units and sixteen (16) two bedroom units.&#10;&#10;The proposed structure will contain approximately 34,000 square feet of gross floor area, with 31 residential units located on four levels. Four (4) of the units, will be designated affordable , pursuant to the City of Boston Inclusionary Development Policy." />
		<string key="phase" value="Construction Complete" />
		<string key="project_type" value="Small Project" />
		<event>
