		<string key="address" value="697 Cambridge Street" />
		<int key="land_sqft" value="11279" />
		<int key="gross_floor_area_sqft" value="28228" />
		<string key="description" value="The proposed development at 697 Cambridge Street has been designed to transform an existing two- story commercial structure into a five-story multifamily residential building while maintaining compatibility with its urban context. The program organizes residential, parking, and support spaces to create a functional and efficient structure that responds to the character of the section of Cambridge Street on which the site sits.&#10;&#10;The building will contain 42 residential units organized across the lower level through the fifth floor. The unit mix is designed to support a diversity of household types, including 17 studios, 15 one-bedroom units, 7 two-bedroom units, and 3 three-bedroom units. Many units will benefit from exclusive-use balconies, offering residents private outdoor space. Interior layouts have been planned to maximize natural light, efficiency, and livability." />
		<string key="phase" value="Board Approved" />
		<string key="project_type" value="Small Project" />
