ers/ComBen_Icons/Parks.png'&gt;&lt;/img&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class='oblastTr'&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;span&gt;Amount:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p&gt;$25,000.00&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;span&gt;Description:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p&gt;Berkeley Community Garden&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='obSeperator'&gt;&amp;nbsp&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class='obFirstTr'&gt;&lt;td class='obName'&gt;Inquilinos Boricuas En Accion, Inc.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img alt= 'Category: Community Based Organizations' title = 'Community Based Organizations' src='http://www.bostonplans.org/images/placeholders/ComBen_Icons/Community Based Organizations.png'&gt;&lt;/img&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class='oblastTr'&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;span&gt;Amount:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p&gt;$25,000.00&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;span&gt;Description:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p&gt;Inquilinos Boricuas En Accion, Inc.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='obSeperator'&gt;&amp;nbsp&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class='obFirstTr obHidden'&gt;&lt;td class='obName'&gt;Redesign of Washington Street&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img alt= 'Category: Public Realm' title = 'Public Realm' src='http://www.bostonplans.org/images/placeholders/ComBen_Icons/Public Realm.png'&gt;&lt;/img&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class='oblastTr obHidden'&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;span&gt;Amount:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p&gt;$45,000.00&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;span&gt;Description:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p&gt;Redesign of Washington Street&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='obSeperator'&gt;&amp;nbsp&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class='obFirstTr obHidden'&gt;&lt;td class='obName'&gt;5% of GFA for use by start-up or non-profit&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img alt= 'Category: Community Based Organizations' title = 'Community Based Organizations' src='http://www.bostonplans.org/images/placeholders/ComBen_Icons/Community Based Organizations.png'&gt;&lt;/img&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr class='oblastTr obHidden'&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;span&gt;Amount:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p&gt;Non-Monetary&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;span&gt;De