		<string key="description" value="The proposed project consists of the demolition of an existing three-family structure at 11 Burney Street, and the construction of a new, approximately 23,975 SF full four-story building. The proposed project includes 24 rental units, of which three (3) will be designated as income restricted, and five (5) garage parking spaces. The proposed project incorporates 1,625 SF of ground floor amenity suite and a 2,853 SF laneway serving as open space for recreational activities." />
