		<string key="description" value='The Trustees of Boston University (the "Proponent") proposes to renovate 380,200 square feet ("sf") of Warren Towers gross floor area ("GFA"), the three-tower student residence (the "Project") which is home to approximately 1,800 undergraduate students at 700 Commonwealth Avenue (the "Project Site") on the Boston University (the "University" or "BU") Charles River Campus. The Project will include repairs to the building’s envelope, reconfiguration of bathroom cores, accessibility improvements, modernization of elevators and escalators, and new mechanical, electrical, and plumbing (“MEP”) systems.' />
