		<string key="description" value='MP Properties II, LLC, an affiliate of Marcus Partners (collectively, the "Proponent"), filed a Project Notification Form ("PNF") with the Boston Planning &amp; Development Agency on February 28, 2022 for the proposed redevelopment of Parcel X in the Raymond L. Flynn Marine Park of the South Boston Waterfront. The Proponent was assigned the existing ground lease for Parcel X, which has an address of 310 Northern Avenue, by the Economic Development and Industrial Corporation ("EDIC") in November of 2020. As detailed in the PNF, the Proponent proposes the demolition of the two (2) existing, single-story industrial buildings on the Project Site, and the construction of a new, two (2)-building, approximately 742,000 square foot life sciences/research and development campus (the "Proposed Project").' />
